title: What about a paramilitary?
view-if: year == 1922 and month == 4
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/Magdeburg_Teilansicht_vom_Domplatz_Magdeburg_anläßlich_der_1_Bundes-Gründungsfeier_22_2_25.jpg‎
tags: event

= What about a paramilitary?

Due to the events of the last years many voices in the <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span> have called for a social and democratic armed organization that can protect both workers and the state.

- @form_para: We have no other choice
- @huuuuuhhuuuuhuhuuh: Why should we do this?

@huuuuuhhuuuuhuhuuh
choose-if: pro_republic >= 67 and spd_votes >= 33
unavailable-subtitle: We have to do something.
on-arrival: spd_chilling_for_real += 1; rb_strength = 1700; 


@form_para

While some voices call for an organisation of republican leaning only closely aligned with the republican parties, others prefer an alliance of the worker's parties arming the working class.

Who should we contact?

- @z_ddp_reichsbanner: We need to protect the Republic at all cost. It will be an alliance with the bourgeois parties.
- @kpd_reichsbanner: We need to protect the workers at all cost. It will be an alliance with worker's parties.
- @spd_reichsbanner: No other party shares our interests to a sufficient extent. It will be the paramilitary of the <span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">**SPD**</span>.


@kpd_reichsbanner
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> won't cooperate with us.
on-arrival: uspd_reichsbanner = 1; kpd_reichsbanner = 1

The <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> is willing to join talks for a united working class paramiltary. Some minor parties have sent delegations as well.

What should be the precise nature of this new organisation?

- @worker_denfense: We will seek to defend striking workers from the forces of the state and reaction.
- @marxist_propaganda: We will seek to educate young men in Marxist theory.
- @kill_these_crakkkkkkerssss: We will seek open combat with the right to weaken them in the long run.


@worker_denfense
on-arrival: reichsbanner_orientation = "Worker Defense"
go-to: reichsbanner_naming


@marxist_propaganda
on-arrival: reichsbanner_orientation = "Marxist Propaganda"
choose-if: left_strength > reformist_strength
go-to: reichsbanner_naming


@kill_these_crakkkkkkerssss
on-arrival: reichsbanner_orientation = "Open Combat"
choose-if: pro_republic < 35
go-to: reichsbanner_naming



@spd_reichsbanner
subtitle: There are some upsides to this.
go-to: reichsbanner_naming



@z_ddp_reichsbanner
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 30 or z_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: The bourgeois parties don't trust us.

We will form a republican paramilitary! Now we have to see who will join us...

- @center_banner: Ask the <span style="color: [+ z_colour +];">**Zentrum**</span>
- @lib_banner: Ask the <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span>
- @rlib_banner: Ask the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
- @lefsoc_banner: Ask the <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span>
- @reichsbanner_naming: That should be all support we can gather.

@center_banner
subtitle: The Center Party is willing
view-if: z_reichsbanner == 0
choose-if: z_relation >= 40 or (ddp_reichsbanner and z_relation >= 35)
unavailable-subtitle: The Center Party is not convinced.
on-arrival: z_reichsbanner = 1
go-to: z_ddp_reichsbanner


@lib_banner
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ ddp_colour +];">**DDP**</span> is willing
view-if: ddp_reichsbanner == 0
choose-if: ddp_relation >= 30
unavailable-subtitle: The DDP is not convinced.
on-arrival: ddp_reichsbanner = 1
go-to: z_ddp_reichsbanner


@rlib_banner
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span> is willing
view-if: rep_dvp >= 180
choose-if: dvp_relation >= 3000
unavailable-subtitle: The DVP won't join such an organisation.
on-arrival: old_middle_dvp -= 100
go-to: z_ddp_reichsbanner


@lefsoc_banner
subtitle: The <span style="color: [+ uspd_colour +];">**USPD**</span> is willing
view-if: uspd_reichsbanner == 0
choose-if: uspd_relation >= 35
view-if: uspd_leader == "Crispien" or uspd_leader == "Breitscheid"
unavailable-subtitle: The USPD is not convinced.
on-arrival: uspd_reichsbanner = 1
go-to: z_ddp_reichsbanner


@reichsbanner_naming

How should this organisation be called?



- @name_reichsbanner: Reichsbanner <span style="color: #000000;">**Schwarz**</span>-<span style="color: #DD0000;">**Rot**</span>-<span style="color: #FFCC00;">**Gold**</span>
- @name_republikanischer_bund: <span style="color: #000000;">**Repub**</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">**likan**</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">**ischer**</span> Bund
- @name_schutzbund: Schutzbund der Demokraten
- @name_arbeiterkampfbund: <span style="color: #DD0000;">**Arbeiterkampfbund**</span>
- @name_proletarischer_schutzbund: <span style="color: #DD0000;">**Proletarischer**</span> Schutzbund
- @name_roter_frontkamperbund: <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**Roter Frontkämpferbund**</span>
- @name_volksbund: <span style="color: #DD1212;">**Volksbund**</span>
- @name_schildbund: Schildbund


@name_reichsbanner
view-if: not kpd_reichsbanner == 1
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Reichsbanner"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_republikanischer_bund
view-if: not kpd_reichsbanner == 1
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Republikbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_schutzbund
view-if: not kpd_reichsbanner == 1
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Schutzbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_arbeiterkampfbund
view-if: ddp_reichsbanner == 0 and z_reichsbanner == 0
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Arbeiterbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_proletarischer_schutzbund
view-if: ddp_reichsbanner == 0 and z_reichsbanner == 0
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Schutzbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_roter_frontkamperbund
view-if: kpd_reichsbanner == 1
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "RFB"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_volksbund
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Volksbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner

@name_schildbund
subtitle: This is the most boring optio you can choose
on-arrival: reichsbanner_name = "Schildbund"
go-to: establish_reichsbanner


@establish_reichsbanner
title: Establish the Paramiltary
on-arrival: rb_strength += 50 if ddp_reichsbanner; rb_strength += 100 if z_reichsbanner; rb_strength += 50 if uspd_reichsbanner; rb_strength += 100 if kpd_reichsbanner; rb_militancy += 0.2 if kpd_reichsbanner; rb_colour = spd_colour; rb_colour = '#DD62AE' if z_reichsbanner or ddp_reichsbanner; rb_colour = '#DD6833' if uspd_reichsbanner; rb_colour = '#9D1D1D' if kpd_reichsbanner





